  "posted_text": "🏢 US HR 10809 — Data Centers Could Face New Electric Costs\n\nYour town could hit pause on new data centers. The Make Data Centers Pay Act aims to protect electricity ratepayers from costs associated with massive data centers and high-density computing facilities. This bill would define what counts as a ‘covered load’ – essentially, any electric use by a data center that’s 20 megawatts or larger, or expected to be. ...\n...",
